class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[The journal of a Gondian worker]\n</p><p><br>\n' 'artifice can outdo magic, given the right smith and a good set of raw materials' - I've carried these words with me all my life, but now I'm beginning to question whether it's really true. Whatever they're doing here with <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher\" title=\"Steel Watcher\">all the steel</a> - it's not for good. Forgive me, <a href=\"/wiki/Gondians\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gondians\">Gond</a>, but if we get out of here alive, I don't think I'll ever touch an anvil again.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715030638\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1911/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32531/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8277/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930738/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.735      1 -total\n 98.22%   44.921      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n 56.14%   25.676      8 Template:Icon_text\n 49.11%   22.461     19 Template:Trim\n 21.33%    9.757      2 Template:Uid\n 16.35%    7.479      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.43%    6.598      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.11%    5.540      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.67%    4.882      1 Template:Books\n 10.08%    4.611      8 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35115-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715030638 and revision id 348589. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}